    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17154,
        "title": "Nomi delle variabili",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145108,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Benvenuto in <strong>JavaScript</strong>, un versatile linguaggio di programmazione per i giochi.</p><p>Analizzeremo in modo approfondito JavaScript, un <strong>linguaggio</strong> di <strong>programmazione</strong> in grado di gestire la logica dei giochi, le animazioni e le interazioni.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145109,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nei giochi è necessario ricordare elementi come la salute del giocatore, il punteggio e la posizione. A questo servono le <strong>variabili</strong> di JavaScript.</p><p>Come gli slot degli oggetti, le variabili memorizzano valori e hanno nomi che ci dicono cosa contengono.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145110,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usiamo <code>const</code> per creare una variabile.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" myVariable\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"set\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145111,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ogni variabile ha bisogno di un <strong>nome</strong>. I nomi delle variabili devono essere costituiti da una sola parola e, pertanto, non possono contenere spazi.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"player score\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"9\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>score</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145112,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per creare nomi di variabili composti da più parole, usiamo il <strong>camel case</strong>. Iniziamo con una lettera minuscola e scriviamo con l'iniziale maiuscola le parole aggiuntive.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"player health\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"16\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>playerHealth</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145113,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per aiutarci a capire cosa contiene una variabile, scegliamo nomi descrittivi.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"eS\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"16\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemySpeed\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>enemySpeed</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145114,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa c'è che non va in questo nome di variabile?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player Health\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Contiene uno spazio</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Contiene una lettera maiuscola</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Contiene uno spazio.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145115,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché diamo alle variabili nomi descrittivi come <code>playerHealth</code> o <code>score</code> invece di <code>x</code> o <code>y</code>?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Per aiutarci a capire cosa contengono</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Per renderli più veloci da digitare</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Per aiutarci a capire cosa contengono.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145116,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quali parole possiamo usare per dichiarare le variabili?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>let</code> e <code>const</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>let</code> e <code>variable</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>let</code> e <code>const</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145117,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A cosa serve il camel case?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Per creare nomi di variabili composti da più parole</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Creare nomi di variabili con spazi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Per creare nomi di variabili composti da più parole.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145118,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scegli il nome di variabile più descrittivo.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"phs\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHighScore\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>playerHighScore</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145119,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi per esteso il termine che indica uno dei modi che usiamo per creare una variabile.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"1\" /><option startIndex=\"1\" endIndex=\"2\" /><option startIndex=\"2\" endIndex=\"3\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>l</code>, seguito da <code>e</code> e infine <code>t</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145120,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Metti i frammenti nell'ordine corretto per creare il nome di una variabile.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"15\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerScore\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>let</code>, seguito da <code>playerScore</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 145121,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la creazione di questa variabile usando <code>let</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>let</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17155,
        "title": "Valori delle variabili",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145122,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I nomi delle variabili possono contenere anche <strong>numeri</strong>. Aggiungere numeri è utile quando hai più variabili simili. Creiamo qui la variabile <code>enemy1</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1 enemy\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy1\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>enemy1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145123,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dopo aver creato e assegnato un nome a una variabile, usiamo il segno <code>=</code> per memorizzare un <strong>valore</strong> al suo interno. Ad esempio, <code>const levelName = \"Forest\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"26\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Forest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>, seguito da <code>\"Forest\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145124,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per completare la creazione di una variabile, mettiamo un punto e virgola, <code>;</code>, alla fine della riga.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Forest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145125,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I valori che abbiamo memorizzato, come <code>\"Forest\"</code>, sono <strong>stringhe</strong>. Le stringhe sono parole racchiuse tra virgolette doppie.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"'\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"'\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"1\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&quot;Forest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"</code>, seguito da <code>\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145126,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le string possono contenere ogni tipo di lettera e simbolo, inclusi gli spazi. Ad esempio, <code>\"Game Over\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"1\" /><option startIndex=\"1\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&quot;Game Over&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"</code>, seguito da <code>Game Over</code> e infine <code>\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145127,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è il valore di questa variabile?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Karin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"Karin\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>playerName</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"Karin\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145128,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come facciamo a sapere che un valore è una stringa?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">È una parola tra virgolette doppie</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Contiene un segno <code>=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">È una parola tra virgolette doppie.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145129,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa sta succedendo in questo codice?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">La variabile <code>gameState</code> memorizza il valore <code>\"Playing\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">La variabile <code>\"Playing\"</code> memorizza il valore <code>gameState</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">La variabile <code>gameState</code> memorizza il valore <code>\"Playing\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145130,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come si chiama questa variabile?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" weapon = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tree shaping&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>weapon</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"Tree shaping\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>weapon</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145131,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea una variabile <code>playerClass</code> e assegnale il valore <code>\"Plumber\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"53\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mario&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerClass = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Plumber&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>let playerClass</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>\"Plumber\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145132,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea una variabile <code>studio</code> e assegnale un valore stringa.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Apple\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" studio = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>let studio</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e poi <code>\"Apple\"</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145133,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assegna alla variabile <code>spawnPoint</code> un valore stringa.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"'\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"'\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" spawnPoint = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Malta&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"</code>, seguito da <code>Malta</code> e infine <code>\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145134,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assegna alla variabile <code>platform</code> il valore stringa <code>\"Desktop\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"26\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" platform = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Desktop&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>\"Desktop\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17156,
        "title": "Differenze tra let e const",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145135,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sappiamo già che possiamo dichiarare variabili con <code>let</code> e <code>const</code>. Scopriamo la differenza tra loro con un gioco!</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145136,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usiamo <code>const</code> per dichiarare valori che non dovrebbero cambiare durante il gioco. <code>const</code> è l'abbreviazione di \"costante\".</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" STARTING_LEVEL = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const</code>, seguito da <code>STARTING_LEVEL</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145137,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se proviamo ad aggiornare un valore memorizzato in una variabile <code>const</code>, riceveremo un errore.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" MAX_HEALTH = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"MAX_HEALTH = \" /><text value=\"120\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145138,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tuttavia, possiamo aggiornare le variabili <code>let</code> con l'operatore di assegnazione <code>=</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"const\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"score = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>let</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145139,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per rendere evidente che una variabile è di tipo <code>const</code> e non dovrebbe cambiare, possiamo facoltativamente denominarla usando lettere maiuscole.</p><p>Crea una costante <code>spawn point</code> in maiuscolo.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"spawnPoint\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"spawn_point\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"17\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" SPAWN_POINT = \" /><text value=\"&quot;TownGate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>SPAWN_POINT</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145140,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Non possiamo usare <code>camelCase</code> se utilizziamo questo standard maiuscolo, quindi usiamo uno <code>snake_case</code> maiuscolo per denominare le variabili con più di una parola.</p><p>Crea una const \"salute massima del giocatore\" in <em>maiuscolo</em> usando <code>snake_case</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"player_max_health\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"playerMaxHealth\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"23\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" PLAYER_MAX_HEALTH = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>PLAYER_MAX_HEALTH</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145141,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sia <code>let</code> che <code>const</code> sono variabili utili e potremmo usarle in modo intercambiabile. Tuttavia, dovremmo cercare di usare <code>const</code> come impostazione predefinita.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" GAME_TITLE = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sprite Quest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145142,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa significa <code>const</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">costante</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">continuo</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere costante.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145143,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo assegnare un nuovo valore a una variabile <code>let</code>.</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">true</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">false</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere true.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145144,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è lo standard facoltativo per assicurarti che le costanti non cambino valore?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">maiuscolo</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">snake case minuscolo</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere maiuscolo.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145145,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa dovremmo usare come valore predefinito?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>const</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>let</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145146,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dichiara correttamente la variabile.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currentLevel = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"currentLevel = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>let</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
