      {
        "id": 17157,
        "title": "Console",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145149,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le righe di codice sono <strong>istruzioni</strong> che un gioco deve seguire.</p><p>Quando eseguiamo il codice, diciamo al gioco di seguire le istruzioni che abbiamo messo insieme.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145150,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'ordine delle istruzioni è importante perché il gioco le segue riga per riga.</p><p>Crea prima <code>step1</code>, poi <code>step2</code> e infine <code>step3</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"89\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" step1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn player&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" step2 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Start game loop&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" step3 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Win level&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const step1 = \"Spawn player\";</code>, seguito da <code>const step2 = \"Start game loop\";</code> e infine <code>const step3 = \"Win level\";</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145151,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Con l'istruzione speciale <code>console.log()</code>, diciamo al computer di visualizzare un valore in un'area chiamata <strong>console</strong>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"27\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game started!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"Game started!\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145152,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare l'istruzione <code>console.log()</code> tutte le volte che vogliamo. Il computer visualizza ogni valore su una riga nella console.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Loading level...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;GO!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>(</code>, seguito da <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145153,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare anche <code>console.log()</code> per visualizzare variabili come <code>playerState</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console.log\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"51\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Idle&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerState);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>playerState</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145154,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando visualizziamo le variabili nella console, compaiono i loro valori invece dei loro nomi. Se qui registriamo <code>enemyName</code>, verrà mostrato il suo valore.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"48\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemyName);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>enemyName</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145155,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come facciamo a sapere che <code>\"Game started!\"</code> è una stringa?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Inizia e termina con le virgolette doppie</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Contiene lettere e simboli</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Inizia e termina con le virgolette doppie.</p></body></html>"
          },
